She's a beauty.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:51.370
She has good style.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:55.390
I'm Kameda Inaho, who just transferred to this school.

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:57.760
I will be teaching politics and economics.

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:00.090
From now on, let's together...

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:03.250
You there, the one putting on his earring!

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:05.040
You've violated the school regulation article two.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:08.470
And the girl there who's sending out e-mails!

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:09.130
Yes!?

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:12.120
You've violated the school regulation article six!

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:13.760
Huh? What's going on?

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.170
She's looking at Inuzuka-kun.

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.340
She is smiling at me this time.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.100
What was that about?

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:29.410
The Confrontation of Rivals, the Horse and the Turtle

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.950
To maintain justice and to protect the civil rights of the victim,

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:36.660
the prosecutor becomes the plaintiff and stands up in the court.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:39.760
The process of prosecution is called a criminal trial.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:42.920
What's article 37 of the constitution?

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:44.240
Article 37...?

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:47.080
In all criminal cases,

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:52.070
the accused shall enjoy the right to a speedy and public trial by all impartial tribunal.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:53.640
He shall be...

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:54.610
Eh...

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:55.890
...permitted full...

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:56.780
Slow!

00:02:57.510 --> 00:03:01.140
...full opportunity to examine all witnesses,

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:05.960
and he shall have the right of compulsory process for obtaining witnesses on his behalf at public expense.

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:10.550
At all times the accused shall have the assistance of a competent counsel.

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:14.870
If the accused is unable to secure the same by his own efforts, one shall be assigned to his use by the state.

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.580
Then what's article 103 of the criminal law?

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:21.420
Article 26 of the criminal law!

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:25.620
No... No way...

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:26.900
That's impossible...

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.360
Are you alright, Inuzuka-kun?

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:32.590
Yes!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.030
Koushi-dono, please keep yourself together.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:38.440
I can't believe Inuzuka-kun lost at law knowledge.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:41.020
I'm sorry, it must be my fault.

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:42.620
Let's go to the nurse's office.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.560
The rest of the class will be independent study.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.220
No way, yay!

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:47.160
Banzai!

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:48.920
No, I'm alright.

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:50.440
Moreover, sensei,

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:52.630
you sure know a lot about law.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:53.920
I guess so.

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:57.080
I wanted to become a prosecutor.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.270
Actually, I'm aiming to become a prosecutor.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:03.350
So that's why you read a lot of law books.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.200
Okay.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:06.470
If there is anything you don't understand, come and ask me.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:07.840
It'll help you a lot.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.000
Thank you.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.290
Hey, Inuzuka-kun.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:15.660
Huh?

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:15.980
Huh?

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.200
Sensei, what is it?

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:20.390
Would you like to come to my place?

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.790
There are some reference materials I want to give you.

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:26.000
They should help you on your study.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.450
I'll go, of course.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:29.960
Let me join you!

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:31.100
I'm coming along too!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.160
I'm sorry, my car has only two seats.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.050
Don't trouble the teacher.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:37.660
Go home without me.

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:38.880
Okay...

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.790
This will come in handy.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:49.050
I'm glad that you think so.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.790
I've followed them because something is troubling me.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.310
A mallet!?

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:57.940
Don't tell me...

00:04:58.740 --> 00:04:59.890
Death penalty!

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:03.230
Kameda-sensei is an assassin!?

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.150
Wha... What are you doing?

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.360
Look.

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:12.800
It's the gravel that was actually used on the trial of Kennedy's assassination.

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.240
Rare, isn't it?

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:16.340
It sure is.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:19.610
I have even more wonderful things.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.610
It's time for me to go home.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:27.150
Oh my, but you've just come.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:28.430
No, it's already...

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:29.550
Really?

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.810
I wanted you to stay until morning.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.240
Then at least, let me drive you home.

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:35.040
Okay?

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:35.980
Eh?

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:37.430
Well, sure...

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:38.960
Then let's go.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:48.470
Am I being overanxious to think that the teacher is an assassin...?

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.470
These notebooks are really old.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.370
Thi... This is...!

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:58.740
...all about the Inuzuka clan...

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:00.020
And in such detail...

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:01.790
But why...?

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.740
Inuzuka-kun, let's have lunch together.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:06.980
Oh, sure.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.670
Inuzuka-kun.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.870
Do you mind if I join you as well?

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:13.060
Sensei...

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.930
I think it's strange for a teacher to have lunch with her students.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.100
Oh my, really?

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:20.850
It's OK, class rep.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:22.260
Go ahead, sensei.

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:23.130
Okay.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.130
It's lunch time, it's lunch time!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:31.740
This is the fruit of my hard labor at work...

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.020
Itadakimasu~

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:37.490
I'm really sorry, Koushi-dono!

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:39.860
A bra!

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:40.820
Huh?

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:42.500
What's this about?

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:43.590
Ahh!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.680
This is my underwear that was stolen!

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.170
Why does Inuzuka-kun have it?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:51.210
Which means...

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:52.950
You are not wearing any bra...

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:53.930
That's not it!

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:57.520
Inuzuka-kun is an underwear thief.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:58.500
That can't be true!

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:01.860
Do you think I, who's aiming to become a prosecutor, would commit theft?

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:03.460
Right, sensei?

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:08.580
You have the right to obtain witnesses and to seek assistance of a counsel.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:10.340
Se... Sensei...

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:16.020
We will start a trial according to article 999 of the school regulation of Fuunji high school.

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:16.990
What!?

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.570
As I thought, this person...

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:22.860
...is Inuzuka-kun's enemy.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.920
The Fuunji high school trial will now be in session.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:32.380
Why is the landlord the judge?

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.080
Order in the court.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:36.990
Exactly.

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:40.480
In that case, prosecutor, you may start the questions.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:47.790
Witness, around 11:00AM, you were instructing the physical education class in this school, correct?

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:48.830
Yes.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:54.640
When you were boasting your Olympic experience as usual, the defendant left without any notice.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:59.790
When you noticed it after a while, you went inside the building to find him.

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:02.020
And what did you see at that time?

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:06.410
I saw the defendant coming out of the girls' change room.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.640
Inuzuka is the culprit after all!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.770
How dare you lie like that!?

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.000
Objection!

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.160
Order!

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:17.650
The prosecutor is currently questioning, please watch your words, attorney.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:19.060
Yes...

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:22.490
Then let me ask the witness another question.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:23.900
Anything.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:28.230
After the defendant left the girls' change room, and returned to his own classroom,

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:30.710
you went after him,

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:32.470
and what did you see there?

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:37.520
I saw the defendant was eating his lunch like a pig with the bra on his head.

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:41.040
That's not possible...

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:44.050
Liar! I was only reading my law books!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.400
Order!

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.230
What did the defendant do to the bra afterwards?

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:55.390
After noticing that I've come, the defendant hid the bra into his empty lunch box.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:56.580
What?

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:58.460
Let me confirm your statement again.

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:02.830
You saw the defendant eating his lunch in the classroom, right?

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:04.960
Yes, indeed.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.850
That's strange...

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.510
Moreover, that's impossible.

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:08.920
Huh?

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:16.710
According to the individual who makes the defendant's lunch, there was nothing in the lunch box to begin with.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.630
Kuzuryuu Momoko-san, is that the case?

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:21.890
Yes...

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:27.220
After Kuzuryuu-san made the foods in the morning, she forgot to put them into the lunch boxes.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:31.300
We have already confirmed that the foods are still in the cooking pan.

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:34.100
I'm really sorry, Koushi-dono...

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:38.090
Nittai-sensei, I think this is what really happened.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:42.950
After you told Inuzuka Koushi to get back to the field,

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:46.120
you stole the bra from the girls' change room yourself,

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:50.270
and placed it in his lunch box to ensure that it'll be discovered during lunch time.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:55.670
When you saw the empty lunch box, you had the wrong impression that Inuzuka-kun ate his lunch already.

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:58.050
Tha... Tha... That's not true!

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:00.000
Nittai-sensei...

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:01.730
The true culprit...

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:03.080
...is you!

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:04.490
Give him the death penalty!

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:06.690
Ten thousand years of imprisonment!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:12.060
I didn't put the bra in Inuzuka's lunch box and tried to frame him for underwear theft!

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:19.000
The trial is now closed.

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:20.780
You did it!

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:24.140
Thanks to senpai, Koushi senpai has been proven innocent!

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.500
Thanks to me?

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:27.500
That's right!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.920
I'm sure Koushi senpai will feel appreciated as well.

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:31.330
Go talk to him.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.910
Ah! Koushi-dono!

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:35.130
Thank you very much.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:36.510
It all thanks to you.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:41.380
You played along in order to catch the true culprit.

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:44.550
Yeah... I was feeling a little uneasy, unsure if I did well.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.090
It was perfect.

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:47.410
Strange...

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:50.230
Why is an assassin helping Inuzuka-kun?

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:52.620
Maybe I should just fight her.

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:56.420
I'm late, I wonder if Inuzuka-kun is angry...

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:57.930
Hold it right there!

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:03.230
I know you are an assassin who's after Inuzuka-kun.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:06.750
I will defeat you before anything happens to him!

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:07.750
Wait.

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:09.170
Nakajima Sanae-san.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.050
I'm not! Really!

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:13.150
I'm Tenchuu warrior, Uma Kamen!

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:15.040
I'm not Nakajima Sanae!

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.140
You don't have to hide it from me.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:18.870
I know everything already.

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:22.260
I'll tell you my true identity too.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:23.920
I am...!

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:35.950
My true identity is...

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:38.490
...a woman from a fallen clan!

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:41.000
A fallen clan?

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.100
A long time ago...

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:47.850
There was a duel with the right of becoming Inuzuka clan's guardian at stake.

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:52.340
A clan that was defeated by the Nakajima clan of the Sandera style.

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:56.640
That was the Kameda clan of the Soude style.

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:58.430
I had no idea...

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:00.870
...that such a history existed...

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:04.520
But rest assured, I don't hold any grudge against the Nakajima clan.

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:07.090
Of course, neither do I want to kill Inuzuka-kun.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.760
If that's the case, then why are you approaching Inuzuka-kun?

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:11.580
To tell you the truth...

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:15.690
My dream is to assume the role of the Inuzuka clan's guardian.

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:18.390
But that's your duty...

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:22.160
So at least, I want to stay by Inuzuka-kun's side and be some use to him!

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.800
That's why I studied law and became a teacher...

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:32.650
If it's for Inuzuka-kun's sake, I'll believe your words.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:34.090
Thank you.

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:36.850
Then since I have a date...

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:43.290
You apply it here.

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:44.700
I see...

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:46.870
I never thought you could explain law this way...

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:49.850
You won't become a prosecutor if you can't do these.

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:50.790
Yes...

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:52.520
Koushi-dono...

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:55.570
Hey.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.830
If there is anything that's troubling you, tell me.

00:12:58.230 --> 00:12:59.620
Troubles, huh?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:03.160
You have to relieve your mind in order to focus on your studies.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:06.210
My family practices martial arts.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.780
And I'm always surrounded by martial artists.

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:10.260
Really?

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:12.430
Inuzuka-kun likes martial arts?

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:13.900
You gotta be kidding!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.750
I hate martial artists!

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:19.960
I hate those weirdoes who call themselves martial artists!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:26.210
I'm worried that I won't be able to become a prosecutor if I'm always with martial artists.

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:27.780
It's alright.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.540
I'm here with you.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:33.080
You just have to think about how to realize your dream.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.560
Sensei...

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.840
I have to help Koushi-dono to realize his dream too.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:43.190
Excuse me, Kuzuryuu-san.

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:43.700
Huh?

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.210
What is it, sensei-dono?

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.900
Please don't feel upset after you hear this.

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:49.350
Yes?

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:53.430
I'm sure you know that Inuzuka-kun is aiming to become a prosecutor.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:57.420
You are an obstacle on the road for him to realize his dream.

00:13:57.670 --> 00:13:59.210
I'm an obstacle!?

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:02.310
Think carefully from his perspective.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:05.360
Koushi-dono...

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:08.810
What should I do...?

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.050
It's raining.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:16.850
Momoko-chan?

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:18.670
Momoko-chan, wait!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:22.310
I see.

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:24.570
That's why you were in the rain...

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:29.660
Koushi-dono needs sensei-dono more than me.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:31.040
Really?

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:34.810
I can't help him with his studies.

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.220
However...

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:41.590
You are influencing Inuzuka-kun in other ways.

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:43.540
"In other ways"...?

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:48.210
I think Inuzuka-kun has changed a little since Momoko-chan came.

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:50.660
Koushi-dono has...?

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:51.790
Yep.

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:59.930
For some reason, I'm feeling all energetic again!

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:01.750
I'm glad.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:04.630
How is it?

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:06.420
It's delicious!

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.060
How's the water?

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:11.320
It's just right.

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:16.470
My goodness.

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:21.150
What a satisfying day.

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.100
I'm glad to hear that.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:28.780
To conclude the day, let's make ascertain of our love.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.850
That hurt!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.390
It's true that I admire you.

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:50.440
But this kind of relationship between a student and a teacher is morally wrong.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.580
I have no intension to have a sexual relationship with you.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:56.910
Is this how you would treat me, after all that I've done for you?

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:04.540
I've spent so many years studying law, even though I had no interest in it.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:07.930
I even studied economics just to get a teacher's license.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:09.940
Everything...

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:13.300
Finally, someone from our clan...

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:16.030
...is to marry into the Inuzuka clan!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.440
And...

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:20.390
...to rule the twelve shinshou!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:27.140
Do you swear that you will love each others in sickness or in health?

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:28.650
I swear.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:30.190
Do you swear?

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:32.700
I swear.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.870
You may seal the oath with a kiss.

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.190
I can finally taste success after so many years of effort.

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.300
No!

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:44.410
Tha... That voice...

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:48.710
Uma Kamen!?

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:52.510
I'm taking Inuzuka-kun back!

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:54.580
Why is she here!?

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:01.580
Inuzuka-kun, it's alright now.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.400
Ka... Kame...?

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.400
Note: "Kame" also means "turtle".

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:12.950
Soude Manne style
Kameda Inaho

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:11.440
In this outfit, I am no longer Kameda Inaho.

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:14.550
I'm the Teppeki warrior, Kame Kamen!

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:14.550
Translation: The warrior of steel wall, masked turtle.

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.520
Soude Manne style
Teppeki warrior Kame Kamen

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:17.400
Now give Inuzuka-kun back to me!

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.120
Inuzuka-kun, wait for me.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:26.540
I won't let you take advantage of Inuzuka-kun for your ambition!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:28.520
How did you...?

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:37.910
A wimpy kick like that can never break through my absolute barrier.

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:39.090
I'm not done yet!

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.590
How did you find out about my ambition?

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:43.570
I thought I have fooled you completely...

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.410
I once believed in you.

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:49.200
But I couldn't trust you anymore after I found out that you made Momoko-chan leave.

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:53.470
I followed you to reveal your true intention.

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.920
Now give it up.

00:17:58.600 --> 00:17:59.240
Shut up!

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:01.590
The future of our clan depends on me!

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:03.550
I can't back down now!

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.380
I won't give you Inuzuka-kun!

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:07.550
No matter what!

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:14.920
Don't interfere with my relationship with Inuzuka-kun!

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:19.990
The guardian of Inuzuka-kun is to be hidden in his shadow, love is forbidden!

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:20.860
You are lying!

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:22.680
What?

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:23.500
Liar!

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:27.110
You love Inuzuka-kun too, don't you?

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:28.920
Tha... That's...

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:42.430
Now to finish you off!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:45.360
You want to marry Inuzuka-kun too, don't you?

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:46.820
Ma... Marry...?

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:50.950
Now is my chance!

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:54.040
Attack the opponent when she shows any weakness between her attacks.

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:57.730
This is the only strategy of a turtle who lacks talent in martial arts!

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:05.230
Inuzuka-kun!

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:10.900
That was close...

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:16.810
I will protect him too!

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.250
I can't hold on anymore...

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:40.890
There is no end to them!

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:42.400
I have to protect him...

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:44.150
I have to protect Inuzuka-kun!

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:08.930
I protected him...

00:20:09.260 --> 00:20:10.320
Inuzuka-kun...

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:13.380
Your devotion towards Inuzuka-kun...

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:15.120
...is not to be underestimated.

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:17.180
You too...

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:18.690
You are serious about him, aren't you?

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:21.700
It started gradually, when I was investigating him.

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:25.940
I wanted to have a normal relationship with Inuzuka-kun.

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:27.700
I know what you mean...

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:29.220
But...

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:33.120
It's a little frustrating, but it seems that your feelings toward him is stronger.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:35.480
I've lost.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.270
Inaho sensei...

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.820
Koushi-dono~!

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.200
Koushi-dono~~!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:45.770
I'm here!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.640
Why is she here?

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:49.900
I told her.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:53.130
Isn't this your chance?

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:53.970
Why...?

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:59.530
I'm happy just to have daily conversations with Inuzuka-kun...

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.290
Daily conversations, huh?

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:08.840
That's right...

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:12.870
